{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108023","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108023/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108023/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108023/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108023","id":3180092930,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc69jF4C","number":108023,"title":"\"Not all code paths return a value\" When matching all cases of an enum","user":{"login":"harrison-munitz","id":39506923,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NTA2OTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39506923?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrison-munitz","html_url":"https://github.com/harrison-munitz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrison-munitz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrison-munitz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrison-munitz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrison-munitz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrison-munitz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrison-munitz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrison-munitz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrison-munitz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harrison-munitz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-26T19:05:20Z","updated_at":"2025-06-27T08:28:54Z","closed_at":"2025-06-27T08:28:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in v4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6800 (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.13031.3015) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900K (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen explicitly declaring an return type, the engine will throw an error if not all code-paths return a value.\n\nIf that function uses a match statement on a variable statically typed to an enum and returns a value for every case of the enum, it will still throw an error, even though it is impossible for the function to not return a value. Instead, you need to include a fallback case to the match (using `_`) or return a dummy value after the match.\n\nIf all values of an enum are matched, and each case returns a value, it should not throw an error.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe following function throws a `Not all code paths return a value.` error:\n\n```\nenum ENUM {A, B}\n\nfunc foo(val: ENUM) -> bool:\n\tmatch val:\n\t\tENUM.A:\n\t\t\treturn true\n\t\tENUM.B:\n\t\t\treturn false\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108023/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108023/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}